			</channel>
			<channel id="electricMotor" typeId="can-flag">
				<label>Motor Under Power</label>
				<description>The motor is delivering drive right now. Teltonika calls the bit "electric engine working"; on a bZ4X it follows the accelerator: ON under power, OFF when coasting, braking or standing - also in READY</description>
